+# make_opt_flags runs twice per MoE layer, ~92x per decode step, and every call
+# re-queried the device and re-read os.environ for values that cannot change
+# while the process lives. get_cdna_version() and the backend query both funnel
+# into HIPDriver.get_current_target(), which issues a real hipGetDeviceProperties
